---
// Hero.astro - Clean Modern Sacred Raksha Bandhan Hero Banner
---

<header class="hero-section">
  <div class="section-badge">
    <span class="badge-symbol">ॐ</span>
    <span data-i18n="shravanaPurnima">Shravana Purnima Celebration</span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="hero-title">
    <span data-i18n="heroTitlePrefix">The Sacred Bond of</span> <br />
    <span class="gold-text" data-i18n="heroTitleGold">Raksha &amp; Eternal Affection</span>
  </h1>

  <div class="shloka-banner hero-shloka">
    <p class="shloka-text">
      येन बद्धो बली राजा दानवेन्द्रो महाबलः।<br />
      तेन त्वां प्रतिबद्धनामि रक्षे मा चल मा चल॥
    </p>
    <p class="shloka-meaning" data-i18n="shlokaMeaning">
      "With the sacred bond by which King Bali was protected, I bind this sacred thread upon you. May it protect and preserve our bond forever."
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="hero-subtitle" data-i18n="heroSubtitle">
    A dignified digital space to celebrate Raksha Bandhan. Experience the traditional Puja Vidhi, 
    design an auspicious Raksha Sutra, and exchange private encrypted sibling letters.
  </p>

  <div class="hero-cta-group">
    <a href="/promi" class="btn-primary promi-hero-btn">
      <span data-i18n="heroCtaPromi">Dedicated Sanctuary for Promi</span>
      <span class="btn-arrow">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <a href="#ceremony-section" class="btn-secondary" data-i18n="heroCtaPuja">
      Puja Vidhi &amp; Aarti
    </a>
    <a href="#rakhi-studio" class="btn-secondary" data-i18n="heroCtaStudio">
      Design Raksha Sutra
    </a>
    <a href="#sankalpa-section" class="btn-secondary" data-i18n="heroCtaVows">
      Raksha Sankalpa Vows
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 1.2rem;
  }

  .hero-shloka {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 1.2rem auto 1.6rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    max-width: 640px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .promi-hero-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F59E0B 0%, #D97706 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .promi-hero-btn:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FBBF24 0%, #F59E0B 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
  }

  .btn-arrow {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .promi-hero-btn:hover .btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-section {
      padding: 2.5rem 0.5rem 2rem;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.1rem !important;
    }
    .hero-cta-group a {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
